Package: VCMoE
Title: Varying-Coefficient Mixture-of-Experts Models
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Qicheng", "Zhao", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "790471666@qq.com"),
    person("Celia M.T.", "Greenwood", role = "aut"),
    person("Qihuang", "Zhang", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Fits Gaussian, Binomial, and Negative-Binomial
    varying-coefficient mixture-of-experts models with local-linear estimation,
    explicit label alignment, bandwidth selection, diagnostics, bootstrap
    inference, confidence bands, coefficient-specific generalized
    likelihood-ratio tests (GLRT) with analytic or bootstrap calibration, and
    local-grid or joint-path expectation-maximization fitting engines. For
    clustered observations it provides cluster-robust (CR2) intervals with
    wild cluster bootstrap bands and path tests, and a cluster-robust screen of
    candidate covariates for expert effects.
